$NetBSD$

Enable runtime AArch64 dispatch on EmberBSD/NetBSD. Intersect CPU features
across attached CPUs; fail safely when the kernel cannot supply them.
SVE needs a userspace state-preservation contract, not only hardware bits.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); not submitted upstream.

--- aom_ports/aarch64_cpudetect.c.orig
